Leda Resort
HORTO - ARGALASTI - PELION - GREECE =

      =

        =


Built amphitheatrically in a beautiful beach of the Pagasetic Gulf in the P=
eninsula of Central Greece,
Leda complex is found just 300 meters away from the center of the picturesq=
ue village of Horto. =

It consists of manors constructed in Pelion architectural style. All lookin=
g on to the sea and the islands of the Gulf.
These manors have rooms, studios, apartments, suits and independent villas =
with a private swimming pool.
Leda complex has its own restaurant and bar by the beach. =


You can also enjoy FREE OF CHARGE our swimming pool, children's pool, child=
ren's playground, tennis court, mini golf, =

table tennis, outdoor chess with oversized pawns, wireless internet, digita=
l safe in your room, =

and through High Season, handcrafting and painting workshop as well as Kid'=
s club.

For a small fee you can take yoga and diving lessons, use our Jacuzzi and s=
auna, try water sports like canoeing and windsurfing, =

or you can rent a boat, a car, motorbikes and bicycles.



